        },
        "57393d7c-eaea-43e6-934b-e35643791451": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 1: Welcome to Cairo - Sunday, April 7th",
            "text": "<p>On arrival at Cairo Airport, you’ll meet a Saba Tours agent and be transferred to your hotel, with time to relax afterwards. Refreshed and ready to embark on your quest to explore prehistoric Egypt, you’ll join your fellow explorers for an introductory meeting and preview of what's to come.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/egypt-tour-day-1-1200x800.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Arrive at Cairo airport and meet Saba Tours assistant</li><li>Transfer from airport to Mena House Hotel</li><li>Welcome Dinner at Mawlana Barbeque restaurant </li><li>Accommodations at Marriott Mena House Hotel</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "46f98c92-e505-4141-a9a0-fa35c3e1337c": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 2: Giza Plateau - Monday, April 8th",
            "text": "<p>Today we are taking you on a day tour of the renowned Giza Plateau, where you'll stand in awe before the Great Pyramids of Giza, marvel at the mysteries of the Valley Temple, and enjoy the sunrise during a private visit of the Sphinx.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Giza_Plateau.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Private sunrise visit to the enclosure of the Sphinx from 6 - 7 am</li><li>Visit Giza Plateau</li><li>Visit the Valley Temple</li><li>Lunch at Hels restaurant</li><li>Overnight at Mena House</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "af9886df-0842-456c-a4da-f86a8fae9128": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 3: Luxor Karnak - Tuesday, April 9th",
            "text": "<p>Today, you will fly to Luxor where you will experience a captivating exploration of the legendary Karnak Temple and to marvel at the Open Air Museum at Karnak. </p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Red_Pyramid.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Breakfast Box</li><li>Fly to Luxor</li><li>Visit Karnak Temple</li><li>Visit the Open-Air Museum at Karnak</li><li>Visit Chapel of Seven Gates</li><li>Lunch at the hotel</li><li>Free evening</li><li>Accommodations at Steigenberger Luxor</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "665f407f-c58f-4cfe-8e14-b0c7e48b8013": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 4: Dendera - Wednesday, April 10th",
            "text": "<p>Immerse yourself in the divine beauty of the Hathor Temple, dedicated to the goddess of love and music.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Karnak.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Early breakfast</li><li>Drive to Dendera at 6:30 am</li><li>Visit Hathor Temple</li><li>Visit Luxor Temple</li><li>Accommodations at Steigenberger Luxor</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "356bfe06-89e2-457a-a782-ada1263e0d36": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 5: West Bank - Thursday, April 11th",
            "text": "<p>Today we will delve into the mysteries of the Valley of the Kings, where the tombs of pharaohs stand testament to a majestic past. Then, get ready to explore the tomb of Ramesseum. Finally, you will behold the towering 700 ton Colossi of Memnon.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Ramesseum_Temple.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Early breakfast</li><li>Drive to West Bank of Luxor</li><li>Visit the Valley of the Kings</li><li>Special access to to the tomb of Rakhmera</li><li>Visit Hatshepsut Temple</li><li>Visit the 700 ton Colossi of Memenon</li><li>Lunch</li><li>Drive to Steigenberger Luxor</li><li>Accommodations at Steigenberger Luxor</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "66db8b2b-fdc9-4434-bd63-38c72353b779": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 6: Cairo - Friday, April 12th",
            "text": "<p>Explore the hallowed halls of the Egyptian Museum in Cairo. </p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Great_Pyramid_2.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Breakfast</li><li>Fly to Cairo</li><li>Visit The Egyptian Museum in Cairo</li><li>Lunch at Kamar restaurant</li><li>Accommodations at The St. Regis Cairo</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "a0ac19a9-eb3f-4293-b194-c7a3b463e4f6": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 7: Sakkara - Saturday, April 13th",
            "text": "<p>The Southern Entrance to the Step Pyramid is the gateway to ancient marvels in Sakkara, Egypt. The entrance adorned with inscriptions and carvings, welcomed visitors to the sacred precinct. The Southern Shaft, a crucial architectural feature within the complex, guided priests, and royalty into the afterlife, facilitating spiritual rituals and access to burial chambers. Close your evening out with a once in a life-time private visit to the Great Pyramid.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Hathor_Temple.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Breakfast</li><li>Drive to Sakkara</li><li>Visit the Step Pyramid Complex</li><li>Explore beneath the Step Pyramid from the Southern Entrance</li><li>Visit a special location at the Southern Shaft (newly opened)</li><li>Lunch at Sakkara restaurant</li><li>Private visit to the Great Pyramid from 7 -9 pm</li><li>Farewell dinner at Mawlana restaurant</li><li>Overnight at the St. Regis Cairo Hotel</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "dd20cdd8-6dc0-42a2-91c4-c110a0716601": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 8: Cairo - Sunday, April 14th",
            "text": "<p>Departure Day</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Great_Pyramid.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<p><strong>Inclusions: </strong></p><ul><li>Breakfast </li><li>Travel to airport</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        }
      },
